From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 05:18:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make dashboard's dealer-count and outstanding tiles open
 their own pages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- "18 · Dealers, Sales dept." previously had no onClick at all (dead
  tap). Now opens a new /staff/sales/my-dealers page.
- "₹X · Total outstanding" previously just scrolled down to the same
  dashboard's inline dealer list. Now opens a new /staff/sales/dues
  page with the same list sorted highest-dues-first.
- Extracted DealerRow (+ its initials() helper) out of SalesDashboard.jsx
  into src/components/staff/DealerRow.jsx so both new pages and the
  dashboard's own inline list render dealers identically (locked-ledger
  badge, field-dealer "New" badge, tap-through to Dealer/FieldDealer
  detail) without duplicating that logic.
- The dashboard's own inline "My Dealers / Parties" list, Add Dealer
  flow, and the My Dealers/My Visits nav tiles are unchanged — only
  the two stat tiles at the top now navigate instead of scrolling.

